  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="afd136dd-4c8c-532b-97c1-4c2ab05df32e" activityNameId="d021939a-6025-510f-beec-d7525fd05507" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">CEM II, A cement, GGBFS with burdens, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: CEM II, A cement, GGBFS with burdens, at plant
The dataset describes the production of cement (CEM II-A) in Switzerland and covers the representative production mix of CEM II/A-D, CEM II/A-LL and CEM II/A-S according to EN 197-1. \nTechnology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Mineralische Baustoffe\nLocal subcategory: Bindemittel\nUVEK 2022 source file:551-Zement-Klinker_v0.13_UVEK2021._CEM II - with burdens.xml\n\n
UUID: b922823d-2e14-3a96-93bb-698a3f0b727e
The activity starts with the clinker in the silo to be used for cement production and with the additional ingredients of the cement at the gate of the cement plant.  The activity includes also the electricy used for the grinding of the clinker, griding aids, heat for the drying of additions etc. and ends with the cement produced in the cement mill. The burdens for the production of ground granulated blast furnace slag (GGBFS) are accounted for (economic allocation).  The dataset does not include packaging and administration.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data represents the average Swiss production of the 6 cement plants that were operational in 2009 - 2009 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b922823d-2e14-3a96-93bb-698a3f0b727e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
